# Smart Learn Autonomous Coding Agent Implementation Plan

Implement the **Smart Learn Autonomous Coding Agent** end-to-end to execute autonomous software development workflows (such as **"Make a login page"**). The system will automatically understand user intent, inspect the workspace, query LLM providers (Gemini/OpenAI/Groq with fallback options), generate structured code, safely write files to local workspace sandbox with checkpointing, run TypeScript & Next.js compiler checks, execute an automated repair loop (max 3 retries) on diagnostics errors, verify DOM rendering via browser verification, and display live progress in `SmartAgentDrawer`.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Architecture & Safety Controls**:
> - **Workspace Sandboxing**: Strict path validation prevents any file reads/writes outside the project root directory (`PermissionManager.resolveSafeWorkspacePath`).
> - **Safety Checkpoint & Rollback**: Destructive or multi-file edits automatically generate a backup snapshot checkpoint (`WorkspaceManager.createCheckpoint`). If the repair loop exceeds maximum retries (3 iterations), changes automatically roll back.
> - **Live Drawer Feedback**: Autonomous execution progress streams live updates into `SmartAgentDrawer` step cards.

